      "paperId": "c5613a396aab446a4733d29b040ac0e5fd42c854",
      "title": "Immanuel Kant\u2019s ideas about the tasks of education in a socio-cultural context: General reconstruction and possibilities of use in the modern field of education",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "M. Averkov",
