      "title": "Immanuel Kant: Idea for a Universal History with a Cosmopolitan Aim\u201d, trans. A. W. Wood, in The Cambridge Edition of the Works of Immanuel Kant: Anthropology, History, and Education",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Ning Wang",
