      "title": "Kant\u2019s Interpretation of the Reflective Faculty of Judgment as a \u201cProto-Hermeneutics\u201d: Review of the Book \u201cThe Roots of Hermeneutics in Kant\u2019s Reflective-Teleological Judgment\u201d by H. Ruthrof",
      "authors": [
